gText_Cedar_Welcome::
	.string "Dear young sir or madam,\n"
	.string "Welcome to the world of Pokémon.\p"
	.string "You are receiving this letter from\n"
	.string "Foster Cedar, the Professor of the\l"
	.string "the Sansuba region.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Cedar_Pokemon::
	.string "Enclosed is a photo of what we call a\n"
	.string "“Pokémon.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Cedar_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is widely inhabited by\n"
	.string "creatures known as Pokémon.\p"
	.string "Humans live alongside Pokémon, at times\n"
	.string "as friendly playmates, and at times as\l"
	.string "cooperative workmates.\p"
	.string "And sometimes, we band together and\n"
	.string "battle others like us.\p"
	.string "Despite this, we do not know everything\n"
	.string "about Pokémon.\p"
	.string "As a Pokémon Professor, it is my job\n"
	.string "to study Pokémon.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Cedar_AndYouAre::
	.string "In order to get a better idea of who\n"
	.string "you are, a form has been attached to\p"
	.string "the backside of this letter to fill out\n"
	.string "and return.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Cedar_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "QUESTION ONE:\p"
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Cedar_WhatsYourName::
	.string "QUESTION TWO:\p"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Cedar_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "NAME: {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Cedar_YourePlayer::
	.string "Thank you for your cooperation,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}{KUN}. Prof. Cedar will be in\p"
	.string "touch with a parent and/or legal\n"
	.string "guardian within the week.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Cedar_AreYouReady::
	.string "Your very own adventure is about to\n"
	.string "unfold.\p"
	.string "Take courage, and leap into the world\n"
	.string "of Pokémon where dreams, adventure,\l"
	.string "and friendships await!\p"
	.string "Come see me in my Pokémon Lab, I have\n"
	.string "something for you!\p"
	.string "$"
